    <briefdescription>
<para>Call sites that get wrapped by a gc.statepoint (currently only in <ref refid="structllvm_1_1_rewrite_statepoints_for_g_c" kindref="compound">RewriteStatepointsForGC</ref> and potentially in other passes in the future) can have attributes that describe properties of gc.statepoint call they will be eventually be wrapped in. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This struct is used represent such directives. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
